                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8BA6C1', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 'auto' }}>每个关键结论都由未参与创作的人按同一套判据重走一遍，逐项对上才写入结论卡。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: '20px 22px', background: 'linear-gradient(150deg, #14294A 0%, #0E2039 100%)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(139,166,193,0.22)' }}>
